<p>This program is made to be a simple but easy to understand note stystem that works between systems.</p>

<h3>How to use</h3>
<p>To use this program, you need to create an account and log in. Once you are logged in, you can create tasks and organize them into lists. You can also share your lists
with other users and collaborate on tasks together.</p>
<p>To create a task, simply click on the "New Task" button and fill out the form. You can add a title, description, and due date for your task. Once you have created a task, you can edit it, mark it as complete, or delete it.</p>
<p>To create a list, click on the "New List" button and give your list a name. You can then add
tasks to your list by clicking on the "Add Task" button and selecting the tasks you want to add. You can also reorder your tasks within a list by dragging and dropping them.</p>
<p>To share a list with another user, click on the "Share" button and enter
the email address of the user you want to share with. The user will receive an email with a link to the list, and they will be able to view and edit the tasks within that list.</p>
<p>Overall, this program is designed to be simple and easy to use, while still providing powerful features for task management and collaboration.</p>